            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 6196594072928659994,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "この前聞いた会長さんのギャグ、\r\nまた思い出しちゃって……はははっ。",
            "enText": "I just remembered the last joke\nof hers you told me… Ahaha!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4609424546616573057,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "トウカイテイオー",
            "enName": "Tokai Teio",
            "jpText": "えぇ！？　まだツボってるの！？",
            "enText": "Huh?! You're <i>still</i> laughing about that?!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": 7660014608914303308,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "だって『テイオーのていをなす』\r\nとか、どんな状況で……あはははっ。",
