            "pathId": 5125631412167753977,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ナイスネイチャ",
            "enName": "Nice Nature",
            "jpText": "はぁ～～。会長さんのギャグ、\nなーんか馴染むんだよねぇ～。",
            "enText": "Phew… Her jokes are great…\nReally remind me of home.",
